    "chapter_id": "61602541dde7f7e33e7cf4fc",
    "chapter_name": "Hyperbola",
    "year": "2023",
    "shift": "shift_1"
  },
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;be the slopes of the tangents drawn from the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the hyperbola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is the point from which the&nbsp;tangents drawn to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;have slopes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math> and they make positive intercepts <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;on the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Equation of tangent to the hyperbola is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>Passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Equation of tangents with slopes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></math></p><p>On converting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;in intercept form we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>128</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
}